:: DayEvent_Router {"position":"1700,550","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<run setup.ensureEventCooldowns && setup.ensureEventCooldowns()>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "day">>

<<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) < 2>>
  <<goto "DayEvent_None">>
<</if>>

<<set _roll = random(1, 3)>>
<<if _roll == 1 and setup.canRouteEvent("day", "DayEvent_SilentTemple")>>
  <<goto "DayEvent_SilentTemple">>
<<else>>
  <<goto "DayEvent_None">>
<</if>>

:: DayEvent_None {"position":"1825,550","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.markRoutedEvent && setup.markRoutedEvent("day", "DayEvent_None", 0)>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "day">>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">절은 조용했다.

낮의 바람만이
무너진 처마 아래를 지나갔다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "Temple">>
<</page>>

:: DayEvent_SilentTemple {"position":"1825,650","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.markRoutedEvent && setup.markRoutedEvent("day", "DayEvent_SilentTemple", 1)>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "day">>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">낮의 절은 무너진 채로 가만히 있었다.

바람만이 처마 끝을 지나갔다.

늑대는 잠시 그 소리를 들었다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "Temple">>
<</page>>
